 "remarks": "Welcome to 25 Cottage Street, Unit 205, a beautifully maintained, move-in-ready 2-bedroom, 1.5-bath townhouse-style condo nestled in a quiet and desirable East Norwalk neighborhood! This inviting home offers the perfect blend of comfort, style, convenience, and energy efficiency. Step inside to an open-concept main level featuring beautiful hardwood floors, elegant crown molding, and a seamless flow between the living, dining, and kitchen areas. The stylish kitchen boasts stainless steel appliances, ample cabinetry, generous counter space, and a convenient pantry. Upstairs, enjoy two spacious bedrooms with vaulted ceilings, abundant natural light, and custom closet systems for optimal storage and organization. Exceptionally energy-efficient, with average electric costs of approximately $140 per month! Additional highlights include garage parking, a dedicated basement storage unit, and assigned parking. Perfectly situated in a peaceful residential setting, yet just a short walk to beautiful waterfront scenery and minutes from East Norwalk's shopping, dining, and entertainment. Quiet, cozy, efficient, and completely turnkey. Schedule your private showing today!",
